    "Are steel, engines, electronics, and plastic all produced domestically (i.e., are all four decision variables representing domestic production quantities), or is some of the steel or electronics obtained purely through import rather than domestic production?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the nature of the decision variables (domestic production vs. import) for the listed materials."
}

